sequenceDiagram
    actor Helen
    participant TP as TrackingPage
    participant TC as TrackingController
    participant OS as OrderStore

    Helen->>TP: Open the saved link
    TP->>TC: getTracking(token)
    TC->>OS: findByToken(token)
    Note right of OS: The random token<br/>(128+ bits) is the<br/>only key. No login,<br/>no app.
    alt Token found
        OS-->>TC: that order only
        TC-->>TP: number, items, status
        TP-->>Helen: Order number and items
    else No such token
        OS-->>TC: nothing
        TC-->>TP: 404, no order data
        TP-->>Helen: Link not valid
    end
